UID: WORK-DISSOLVE-THE-FRAGMENT-SYSTEM
TITLE: Dissolve the fragment system into representations rendered from the canon
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
Dissolve the fragment system. Once the knowledge it carries is in the canon,
the path-scoped fragments, their registry and the generated projections
(the Claude rules, the Copilot instructions, the Kiro steering) become
representations rendered from the canon rather than sources of their own,
and the generator that composes them retires.
<<<
